@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam roundcorner 6
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam stateBackgroundColor #F8FAFC
skinparam legendBackgroundColor #FFF7DB
hide empty description
title Figure 19. LearningAgreement lifecycle (Alin)
state "Active agreement before departure" as ActiveAgreement {
 [*] --> DRAFT
 DRAFT --> SUBMITTED : submissionRequested\n[ownerAuthorized && mappingsEligible && totalCredits >= 30]\n/ submit(checks, actorId)
 SUBMITTED --> UNDER_REVIEW : reviewStarted\n[coordinatorAuthorized]\n/ beginReview(coordinatorId)
 UNDER_REVIEW --> DRAFT : changesRequested [reasonProvided]\n/ requestChanges(actorId, reason)
 UNDER_REVIEW --> APPROVED_BY_FACULTY : facultyApprovalRequested\n[currentVersion && academicChecksPassed]\n/ approveByFaculty(actorId)
 APPROVED_BY_FACULTY --> CONFIRMED_BY_HOST : hostEvidenceRecorded\n[officerAuthorized && evidenceMatchesApprovedRevision]\n/ confirmByHost(officerId, proofRef, now)
}
[*] --> ActiveAgreement
ActiveAgreement --> CANCELLED : withdrawalConfirmed [beforeDeparture]\n/ cancel(actorId, reason, now)
CANCELLED --> [*]
legend bottom
 A transition from the composite state applies to every active substate.
 ActiveAgreement groups states; it is not an additional Enum literal.
 Host confirmation produces HOST_CONFIRMED. The application commits
 the agreement, decision history and outbox together; delivery follows later.
endlegend
@enduml
